title: Renaissance Round A — the calibration moat, made renderable
summary: 'Built the server data layer for the Tasks section''s headline (story-points = learned calibration). The key find: resolveAgentEstimate ALWAYS had n + learned/prior provenance in its LearnedBand cells — it just threw them away, returning bare {min,max}. Widened it to {min,max,n,source} (additive), added estimateForTask() and assembleCalibrationGrid(); wired /api/tasks + /board to attach a per-task estimate and added /api/tasks/calibration. Proven via unit tests (cold-start all-prior grid + a seeded learned table → source:learned with n). MCP 438 / CLI 441 green.'
